  "notes": "{出費|しゅっぴ} refers to money spent or expenses incurred.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧かさむ: expenses pile up\n- ⟦{予想外|よそうがい}→予想外：03188_yosougai⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{出費|しゅっぴ}: unexpected expense\n- ⟦{大|おお}きな→大きな：02849_ookina⟧{出費|しゅっぴ}: major expense\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{抑|おさ}える→抑える：12806_osaeru⟧: to keep expenses down\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{控|ひか}える→控える：10054_hikaeru⟧: to cut back on spending\n\nUSAGE:\n- Neutral term for spending money\n- Often used when discussing budgets or financial planning",
